{"page":445,"verses":[{"verse_key":"36:71","surah":36,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّا خَلَقْنَا لَهُم مِّمَّا عَمِلَتْ أَيْدِينَآ أَنْعَـٰمًا فَهُمْ لَهَا مَـٰلِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can they not see how, among the things made by Our hands, We have created livestock they control,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّا","en_gloss":"that We","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقْنَا","en_gloss":"[We] created","transliteration":"khalaqnā","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّمَّا","en_gloss":"from what","transliteration":"mimmā","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَمِلَتْ","en_gloss":"have made","transliteration":"ʿamilat","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيْدِينَآ","en_gloss":"Our hands","transliteration":"aydīnā","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَنْعَـٰمًۭا","en_gloss":"cattle","transliteration":"anʿāman","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"then they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَهَا","en_gloss":"[for them]","transliteration":"lahā","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَـٰلِكُونَ","en_gloss":"(are the) owners","transliteration":"mālikūna","verse_key":"36:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٧١","en_gloss":"(71)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:71"}]},{"verse_key":"36:72","surah":36,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"وَذَلَّلْنَـٰهَا لَهُمْ فَمِنْهَا رَكُوبُهُمْ وَمِنْهَا يَأْكُلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and made them obedient, so that some can be used for riding, some for food,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَذَلَّلْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"And We have tamed them","transliteration":"wadhallalnāhā","verse_key":"36:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"36:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَمِنْهَا","en_gloss":"so some of them ","transliteration":"famin'hā","verse_key":"36:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَكُوبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"they ride them","transliteration":"rakūbuhum","verse_key":"36:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمِنْهَا","en_gloss":"and some of them","transliteration":"wamin'hā","verse_key":"36:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَأْكُلُونَ","en_gloss":"they eat","transliteration":"yakulūna","verse_key":"36:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٧٢","en_gloss":"(72)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:72"}]},{"verse_key":"36:73","surah":36,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ فِيهَا مَنَـٰفِعُ وَمَشَارِبُ ۖ أَفَلَا يَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"some for other benefits, and some for drink? Will they not give thanks?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"And for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"36:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"36:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَنَـٰفِعُ","en_gloss":"(are) benefits","transliteration":"manāfiʿu","verse_key":"36:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَشَارِبُ ۖ","en_gloss":"and drinks","transliteration":"wamashāribu","verse_key":"36:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَفَلَا","en_gloss":"so (will) not","transliteration":"afalā","verse_key":"36:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَشْكُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they give thanks","transliteration":"yashkurūna","verse_key":"36:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٧٣","en_gloss":"(73)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:73"}]},{"verse_key":"36:74","surah":36,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱتَّخَذُوا۟ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ ءَالِهَةً لَّعَلَّهُمْ يُنصَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet they have taken other gods besides God to help them,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱتَّخَذُوا۟","en_gloss":"But they have taken","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadhū","verse_key":"36:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"36:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"36:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","translite