the All-Knower","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","verse_key":"36:81"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٨١","en_gloss":"(81)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:81"}]},{"verse_key":"36:82","surah":36,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ أَمْرُهُۥٓ إِذَآ أَرَادَ شَيْـًٔا أَن يَقُولَ لَهُۥ كُن فَيَكُونُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"when He wills something to be, His way is to say, “Be”- and it is!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَمْرُهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"His Command","transliteration":"amruhu","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِذَآ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَرَادَ","en_gloss":"He intends","transliteration":"arāda","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَيْـًٔا","en_gloss":"a thing","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَقُولَ","en_gloss":"He says","transliteration":"yaqūla","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُن","en_gloss":"Be","transliteration":"kun","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَيَكُونُ","en_gloss":"and it is","transliteration":"fayakūnu","verse_key":"36:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:82"}]},{"verse_key":"36:83","surah":36,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"فَسُبْحَـٰنَ ٱلَّذِى بِيَدِهِۦ مَلَكُوتُ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ وَإِلَيْهِ تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So glory be to Him in whose Hand lies control over all things. It is to Him that you will all be brought back.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَسُبْحَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"So glory be","transliteration":"fasub'ḥāna","verse_key":"36:83"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(to) the One who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"36:83"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِيَدِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in Whose hand","transliteration":"biyadihi","verse_key":"36:83"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَلَكُو